# NOTE: audit_artifacts/ is intentionally NOT listed here — the directory-level
# ignore was removed (S145 bug-fix) because it overrode the !audit_artifacts/baselines/**
# and related exceptions defined above (lines 52-62). git does not descend into
# a dir/ -ignored directory, making those exceptions unreachable. The existing
# audit_artifacts/** + explicit exceptions handle exclusions correctly.

